※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4104 LANG_IMPORT_NOT_EXPORTED

※ What a module imported for itself is its own: without `@[export]` on the import,
※ a file importing it cannot reach through it.

let std := ⎕import("std")
let kept := ⎕import("kept")

@[startup]
fn main(init: std.Init) → u6:
    ⎕narrow(kept.inner.twice(1u8), ⌜u6⌝) ?? 0u6
